  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oil spill prot Est</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Oljeskadeskydd Est</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An increased activity of oil cargo transports in the Baltic Sea region calls for a strengthening of the oil and pollution response capacity. The cooperation project between the Swedish Coast Guards and the Estonian Border Police contains a training package on oil spill response at sea and oil spill sampling equipment. The Swedish MFA will furthermore finance a vessel equipped for oil spill response</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den &#xF6;kande oljetrafiken i &#xD6;stersj&#xF6;n med h&#xF6;jda risker f&#xF6;r oljeskador, f&#xF6;ranleder en h&#xF6;jd beredskap avseende oljeskadeutsl&#xE4;ppsbegr&#xE4;nsning. Samarbetsprojektet mellan svenska Kustbevakningen och estniska gr&#xE4;nspolisen inriktas p&#xE5; utsl&#xE4;ppsbek&#xE4;mpning och provtagning. D&#xE4;rut&#xF6;ver kommer svenska UD finansiera leverans av ett milj&#xF6;saneringsfartyg.</narrative>
  </description>
